   "built" -> "{2026, 10, 26, 1, 55, 18.2606124}", 
    "history" -> {"1.0", "", "", ""}, "context" -> 
    "EricJamesParfitt`CyclicTagCompiler`", 
    "keywords" -> {
     "cyclic tag system", "tag system", "rewriting system", "NKS"}, 
    "specialkeywords" -> {}, "tutorialcollectionlinks" -> {}, "index" -> True,
     "label" -> "Eric James Parfitt/ Cyclic Tag Compiler Symbol", "language" -> 
    "en", "paclet" -> "EricJamesParfitt/CyclicTagCompiler", "status" -> 
    "None", "summary" -> 
    "CyclicTagSystem[rules, init, t] returns the list of states attained from \
evolving init, using cyclic tag system rules over t steps. \
CyclicTagSystem[rules, init] gives the result of evolving init for one step. \
CyclicTagSystem[rules, init, t, dt] returns the states attained at every step \
dt. CyclicTagSystem[rules, init, t, dt, prop] returns the specified prop of \
states attained at every step. CyclicTagSystem[rules] is an operator form of \
CyclicTagSystem that represents one step of evolution.", "synonyms" -> {}, 
    "tabletags" -> {}, "title" -> "CyclicTagSystem", "titlemodifier" -> "", 
